        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: 1998 West Virginia Mountaineers football team, 1998 Missouri Tigers football team\n- Organizations: West Virginia University, Big East Conference\n- Events: 1998 NCAA Division I-A football season, 1998 Insight.com Bowl\n\nFacts:\n- The 1998 West Virginia Mountaineers football team represented West Virginia University in the 1998 NCAA Division I-A football season.\n- The 1998 West Virginia Mountaineers football team was West Virginia's 106th overall football team and its eighth season as a member of the Big East Conference.\n- The Big East Conference was a collegiate athletics conference of as many as 16 universities in the eastern half of the United States from 1979 to 2013.\n- The 1998 Insight.com Bowl featured the Missouri Tigers and the West Virginia Mountaineers.\n- The 1998 Missouri Tigers football team finished with an 8-4 overall record and a 5-3 conference record.\n- The 1998 Missouri Tigers football team defeated West Virginia 34-31 in the 1998 Insight.com Bowl at Tucson.",
